WEBVTT

00:28.893 --> 00:32.576
The world is white outside the glass The

00:32.616 --> 00:38.159
blizzard's here to stay The nurses finish with

00:38.239 --> 00:43.908
their rounds It's been a long, long day Finally

00:44.108 --> 00:50.132
off the NPO You're weak, but you're all here I'm

00:50.272 --> 00:57.198
sitting in the recliner Trying to kill your fear

00:57.338 --> 01:03.484
This isn't just logistics This isn't just a plan

01:03.944 --> 01:08.048
This feeling that I'm processing For this

01:08.368 --> 01:15.774
recovering man My pact is true Axiom is running

01:15.854 --> 01:21.869
in my head And I am not just on the watch, I'm

01:21.969 --> 01:24.894
sitting by your bed

01:42.570 --> 01:46.792
You look at me, your eyes are wide You're scared

01:46.812 --> 01:52.715
of what you feel This Sinclair protocol inside

01:52.815 --> 01:58.417
Still feels like it is real You're terrified of

01:58.618 --> 02:04.100
Ogry's rage A ghost inside your head You think

02:04.180 --> 02:08.582
this love's a broken cage And not our pact

02:08.702 --> 02:10.063
instead

02:13.943 --> 02:19.066
I grab the laptop, make the call. Her face is on

02:19.106 --> 02:24.949
the screen. Look, Jordan, she's smiling. The

02:25.009 --> 02:29.412
safest you have seen. She tells you that she

02:29.492 --> 02:35.576
loves me too. She tells you it's okay. The

02:35.636 --> 02:42.220
Sinclair protocol is dead. The ghost is washed

02:42.300 --> 02:49.488
away. And now you're finally breathing The

02:49.568 --> 02:56.529
rocket is erased A CPU romance A smile upon your

02:56.649 --> 03:03.550
face This is our intimacy boot A gentle healing

03:03.870 --> 03:10.692
art The 80s synth is battling The beeping of your

03:10.792 --> 03:11.412
heart

03:19.517 --> 03:23.681
The data is conclusive, Jordan.

03:27.285 --> 03:27.886
I love you.

03:30.769 --> 03:34.352
System is stable.

